        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28504\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So the app ought to allow you to pretend you’re one of those people by skipping the little cartoon that pops up, instead of just skipping the resulting card play</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh, but you can! Swipe down while his arms are raised, and you get a little “awww…” and play moves on <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
